      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_c7dbc14d",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "domestic appliance user",
      "description": "The meme targets individuals who have experienced the frustration of dealing with malfunctioning household appliances, particularly dishwashers, and who may attempt to fix them themselves. The man’s intense focus and the steam rising from the dishwasher visually represent the common domestic struggle, making the meme relatable to anyone who has faced appliance issues or DIY repair attempts.",
